# Pure SaaS: /pure-saas migrate

Modernize or migrate an existing interface or styling architecture incrementally without regressions.

## Usage
Type `@pure-saas-migrate [request]` or `/pure-saas migrate [request]` in Composer or Chat.

## Instructions
1. Map legacy classes, hex colors, and components to semantic tokens in `DESIGN.md`.
2. Strictly preserve all backend API routes, server actions, database models, and authentication.
3. Retain test IDs (`data-testid`, `id`) relied on by existing automated test suites.
4. Do not rewrite frameworks or add heavyweight dependencies unless explicitly requested.
5. Execute migration in safe incremental passes, verify with `node scripts/pure-saas.mjs check-tokens DESIGN.md --source src`, and run test suites.
